JZTxhX5R9BJ_Kw3FFEeaLw&oe=6B0EF900"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverVideo.png", "id": "1360729479359216", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839701_1360729486025882_6938024117182266109_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zj6B-qq92FYQ7kNvwHVvk3U&_nc_oc=AdoRadZsnbgF9XVX63KBW0IJxANT2xG-iEG5slqkw5nCQxrUsXU_dBuOe740ym1xX_A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWMgcilucn0sYiw69BT297kwfF6U3Y-c4fyI_H3uWuAow&oe=6B0EF5CD"}, "display_name": "Through Another World: Walking Trails", "keywords": ["treadmill", "Fitness", "Winter", "Walking", "Fantasy"], "long_description": "Early Access. Through Another World is a treadmill walking experience built for simple, comfortable control. Set your speed, switch trails, listen to instrumental music, and journey through new worlds as they release.\n\nThis app is a personal project as I enjoy walking in VR during the months when it's too hot, cold, or impractical to be outside.\nYour feedback is greatly appreciated. What you like, what feels off, and what you\u2019d like to see next. See developer website. \n\nTrailhead 1 includes three trails:\nFrozen Battle: a 2-mile out-and-back through a frozen battlefield, with occasional statues frozen in place.\nWinter Ruins: a 1.3-mile loop through snowbound ruins.\nMoss Ruins: a 1.3-mile loop through the same route in a different season and weather. Handmade environments, no generative AI.\n\nEach trailhead is a set of trails in a similar setting. More trailheads with different vibes are in development, with richer environments, music, and story. Future updates may add a carriage or soaring mode for relaxed sightseeing.\n\nDuring Early Access, all updates including new trails and trailheads will be free. Once the app goes fully live some paid DLCs may also be released. There are no plans to offer a subscription. You own your purchase and content received through free updates.\n\nSafety. Use at your own risk on a treadmill with clear space around you. Talk to a doctor before exercising if you\u2019re new to exercise or have a health condition.", "short_description": "Early Access treadmill walks through quiet, otherworldly places. Cross a frozen battlefield and wander snowbound or mossy ruins. Pick your music, see your feet through passthrough, and pick up where you left off with auto-saving. Three trails available now, more trailheads coming soon. Handmade environments, no generative AI."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://rollemfilms.com/throughanotherworld-privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rollem Interactive", "support_website_url": "https://rollemfilms.com/contact/", "website_url": "https://rollemfilms.com/throughanotherworld/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1417903061416063"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839654_1167144769165108_3151048986810931220_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=buKjU8eJYIcQ7kNvwGJWCM6&_nc_oc=Adrn-D6MQkJdj7lwYocx7gvLGzbfZnQoDthWt2VIWHXGJn8kMf-gTNbyHdK-YwgW6JY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXMAIWrRWhH5ZdbDKbYWedezl5AaxsZz_