, "id": "1077878828600662", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593734382_1077878831933995_8226862544856208724_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6k2PwbukQOQQ7kNvwG9ryPk&_nc_oc=Adrwt79udEQixXcmKvHEfDKkrMRLsgrruaHpDKscZZIt5jYwl-Uo7CCkCHebHv32Tog&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWljUJF5MJGyUd7cWCojH4Ewl_nGDXJ8hEzYkK6PnHx3Q&oe=6B0F0742"}, {"file_name": "ThruWorld_Screenshot4.png", "id": "3212969852233614", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620532_3212969855566947_7906124106686989994_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-iiNk6HbaecQ7kNvwG8hlbY&_nc_oc=AdpUJIw97TnrjylG5mj-9ZmMAQ6ymsphbKbsy3R7r4Yxlxsz9gXprrMsOccQLdrLso0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV9mLmjWN6uIygL-Yk49rr8dAGE4ZHqL0ab8a973_AvlA&oe=6B0F1EC8"}, {"file_name": "ThruWorld_Screenshot6.png", "id": "995974496283869", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593718973_995974499617202_307557528808630397_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xi1jUDT3YW0Q7kNvwEai4bB&_nc_oc=Adrq8sfPZ0lhY-3cpM_vDfbTWii4tiTsyrbBGVim268k6_Zb4phzFMKX3OpLz2eOBGM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXc6NxnQb987bMJTYOT23YXJZTxhX5R9BJ_Kw3FFEeaLw&oe=6B0EF900"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Through Another World", "keywords": ["treadmill", "Fitness", "Winter", "Walking", "Fantasy"], "long_description": "Early Access. Through Another World is a treadmill walking experience built for simple, comfortable control. Set your speed, switch trails, and adjust your setup smoothly and simply. Press B at any time to see the controls. \n\nThis app is a personal project as I enjoy walking in VR during the months when it's too hot, cold, or impractical to be outside.\nYour feedback is greatly appreciated. What you like, what feels off, and what you\u2019d like to see next. See developer website.\n\nTrailhead 1 includes three trails:\nFrozen Battle: a 2-mile out-and-back through a frozen battlefield, with occasional statues frozen in place.\nWinter Ruins: a 1.3-mile loop through snowbound ruins.\nMoss Ruins: a 1.3-mile loop through the same route in a different season and weather.\n\nEach trailhead is a set of trails in a similar setting. More trailheads with different vibes are in development, with richer environments, music, and story. Future updates may add a carriage or soaring mode for relaxed sightseeing.\n\nDuring Early Access, all updates including new trails and trailheads will be free. Once the app goes fully live some paid DLCs may also be released. There are no plans to offer a subscription. You own your purchase and content received through free updates.\n\nSafety. Use at your own risk on a treadmill with clear space around you. Talk to a doctor before exercising if you\u2019re new to exercise or have a health condition.", "short_description": "Early Access treadmill walks through other worlds. Manually set your own pace to match your treadmill, see your feet through passthrough, and explore Trailhead 1: a frozen battlefield and two loops through winter and mossy ruins. More trailheads with various vibes, audio features, and clearer visuals are in development during early access."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://rollemfilms.com/throughanotherworld-privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rollem Interactive", "support_website_url": "https://rollemfilms.com/contact/", "website_url": "https://rollemfilms.com/throughanotherworld/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1390211107518592"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2390027751565332"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2390027751565332"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1794951000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2390027751565332"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1411786178694418", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "2308575556651639", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1390211104185259", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1411786178694418"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2308575556651639"}]}, "change_log": "\"New in this update:\\n- Instrumental music is now included.\\n- Choose a music genre and song.\\n- Resume a path where you left off, instead of starting over.\\n- Your progress along each path is saved automatically.\\n- Adjust music volume and sound effects volume separately.\\n- The right stick now chooses whether it adjusts speed, music, or volume. Press B to see the controls.\"", "created_date": 1795202006, "id": "1411786178694418", "version": "1.0", "version_code": 2, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__